# Naming

Only `ID`, `HP`, `NPC`, `URL`, `UTC`. Not HTTP, JSON, or units — casing there is meaning (`Mb` ≠ `MB`, `Ms` ≠ `MS`).

Never `Id`, `Hp`, `Npc`, `Url`, `Utc`. PascalCase: `NPCDirector`. camelCase: `npcID`, `fromURL`. Whole name: `id`, `hp`, `npc`, `url`, `utc`.

Timestamps: game time is `timestamp`; UTC fields end `_utc`. Not `at`.
